# Choices and labels
@scenario tutorial_lesson_10
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip guide present]
pip: Each choice points to a label. The game continues at the label the player selects.
pip: Look at the two choices below. Follow each destination in the script.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
pip: What does the arrow after a choice point to?
> A sprite expression. -> retry
> A destination label. -> correct
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show pip guide curious]
pip: Each branch can perform different work before both paths meet. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip guide cheer]
pip: Each branch can perform different work before both paths meet.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_10]
[flag tutorial_done_10]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_1]
